# Copy to mosquitto/config/acl. Least privilege per client.

# Frigate publishes its own topics only
user frigate
topic readwrite frigate/#

# Backend reads Frigate, owns visionguard/*
user visionguard_backend
topic read frigate/#
topic readwrite visionguard/#

# Node-RED (optional) consumes events and may only request actions
user nodered
topic read visionguard/events/#
topic write visionguard/actions/requests
